ToDo — unfinished results (still containing `sorry`)
====================================================
Line numbers refer to the files as of 2026-11-27 (commit 265be7b), unless
a section says otherwise. They will drift as files change. Only pending
tasks are listed; completed ones are removed.


AbstractNonsense/PullbackAddGrp.lean
------------------------------------
[ ] AddGrpObj (pullback f g)                                         (l.47)
      The pullback of two group homomorphisms f : G → T, g : H → T is
      again a group object (addition and zero taken componentwise).
      zero and add are defined, and the lift conditions
      (zero_lift_condition, add_lift_condition) are proved.
      zero_add is started (two `have`s and the final goal left as sorry,
      l.59, 60, 62). Still missing: add_zero (l.63), add_assoc (l.64),
      neg (l.65), left_neg (l.66), right_neg (l.67).

[ ] IsCommAddMonObj (pullback f g)                                   (l.70)
      If G and H are commutative, so is their pullback.

[ ] IsAddMonHom (pullback.fst f g)                                   (l.76)
      The projection G ×_T H → G is a group homomorphism.

[ ] IsAddMonHom (pullback.snd f g)                                   (l.78)
      The projection G ×_T H → H is a group homomorphism.

[ ] IsAddMonHom.pullback_lift                                        (l.80)
      A map into the pullback built from two group homomorphisms is
      itself a group homomorphism.

[ ] Cleanup: commented-out `--instance : HasPullbacks (AddGrp C) := sorry`
      (l.28).


