      f₁ / f₂ in left_add_eq_tan (l.562, 564; hφ₁ / hφ₂ are taken; e.g.
      hφc₁ / hφc₂).
[ ] Possibly replace the `erw`s (residueFieldCongr_residueFieldMap l.90,
